%description:

Tests that Ieee8021adPolicy applies the access and trunk port types of IEEE
802.1Q-2018 in a C-VLAN bridge. The network and the traffic are described in
lib/vlan-access-trunk.ini, and the bridges are configured by port type as in
lib/ieee8021ad-access-trunk.ini: two bridges joined by a trunk, VLAN 10 with
the hosts a1, a2 and a3, and VLAN 20 with b1 and b2, where a1 and b1, and a3
and b2, use the same MAC address.

The frame counts and the received data are those of VlanIndMapper_1, which
configures the same ports with the four modules of VlanPolicyLayer, and thus
those of two separate pairs of plain switches without VLANs: each VLAN is a
forwarding domain of its own. The bridges forward the PCP (the default), and
the hosts of the access ports, which have no 802.1Q layer, still receive all
of their data, so no frame leaves an access port with a priority tag. a2 sends
priority-tagged frames, and the access port eth1 of bridge1 classifies them
into VLAN 10 (6.9.1 f).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib
include ../../lib/ieee8021ad-access-trunk.ini

%subst: /\x1B\[[0-9;]*m//

%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a1.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 27
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a2.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 27
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.b1.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 26
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a3.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 98
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.b2.eth[0].macLayer.fcsChecker incomingPackets:count 49
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a3.app[0] packetReceived:sum(packetBytes) 131072
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.b2.app[0] packetReceived:sum(packetBytes) 65536
%contains: stdout
VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.bridge1.ieee8021q.qTagHeaderInserter: Setting VID, vid = 10.
%contains: stdout
VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.bridge1.ieee8021q.qTagHeaderInserter: Setting VID, vid = 20.
%contains: stdout
VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.a2.ieee8021q.qTagHeaderInserter: Setting VID, vid = 0.
%contains: stdout
VlanAccessTrunkTestNetwork.bridge1.bridging.vlanPolicy: Classifying received frame into the VLAN of the port, interfaceName = eth1, vlanId = 0, portVlanId = 10
